message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "RISE Hedging Simulation"
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Lucas
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
repository-code: "https://github.com/2nnm2fnnzq-prog/RISE-Hedging-Simulation"
url: "https://github.com/2nnm2fnnzq-prog/RISE-Hedging-Simulation"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Simulation code and compact results comparing contract-specific
  implied-volatility Black-Scholes delta, plain Heston delta, and
  correlation-adjusted Heston hedging. The frozen version-2 protocol
  evaluates mean squared terminal hedging error after transaction costs
  under structural-parameter perturbations and discrete rebalancing.
keywords:
  - option hedging
  - Heston model
  - Black-Scholes model
  - stochastic volatility
  - parameter uncertainty
  - transaction costs
  - Monte Carlo simulation
